+## AGC 26.2 alpha16 - logic and algorithm optimisation plane
+
+Alpha16 moves beyond efficiency bookkeeping and adds direct algorithmic improvements for the thousand-player survival goal:
+
+- `AGCScale16ControlLaw`: EWMA/derivative control law that shifts invisible-work budget according to real MSPT pressure instead of static per-feature limits.
+- `AGCPlayerMotionIntentModel`: player movement intent prediction for read-only chunk/entity planning. It does not alter movement, physics, view distance or chunk commit order.
+- `AGCChunkLookaheadPlanner`: motion-aware stable chunk lookahead hints. It prepares future interest without skipping FIFO queue heads or reordering Paper chunk completion.
+- `AGCEntitySpatialBandIndex`: stable read-only entity candidate bands so dense tracker scans avoid duplicate distance work without skipping entity ticks, AI, damage or interactions.
+- `AGCNetworkDeltaShapePlanner`: lossless packet delta/shape planning. It never drops packets, shares mutable packets or reorders a connection stream.
+- `AGCWorldLogicPhaseDAG`: hard-coded Minecraft logic phase DAG. Read-only snapshot/intent/fanout/graph phases may prepare concurrently, while redstone, block entity, entity tick, plugin event and ordered commit phases remain barriers.
+- `AGCPluginSemanticModel`: conservative plugin-operation classifier that routes Bukkit-visible mutation to ordered commit and admits only pure/read-only helper work to spare capacity.
+
+Operator report: `/agc scale16`. Public API: `AGC.performance().scale16Plan(players, targetTps)` and `AGCScale16Plan`.
+
